            <ArticleTitle>[Pain in the breeding of fish].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>74-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Excessive breeding leading to suffering in animals only exists in ornamental fish, especially in gold fish or poecillids. These varieties are physically handicapped in locomotion, feeding and/or reproduction in comparisation to wild fish.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
